        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Show Your Tin Cup Spirit – Run. Celebrate. Give.</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/54196.webp" alt="Show Your Tin Cup Spirit – Run. Celebrate. Give." loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>Lace up your sneakers, bring your friends and family, and show your community support at the&nbsp;18th Annual Tin Cup Challenge Event Day&nbsp;hosted by the&nbsp;Community Foundation of Teton Valley&nbsp;on&nbsp;Saturday, July&nbsp;19th in Driggs City Park!</p>

<p>This treasured community celebration is more than a race – it’s a rally for local nonprofits and a powerful reminder of what we can accomplish when we come together in the spirit of generosity. Whether you are running, cheering, or giving,&nbsp;you’re part of the impact.</p>

<p><strong>Start the Day Strong</strong><br>Run (or walk!) for good.</p>

<ul>
<li>9:00 AM&nbsp;– Timed 5K/10K races</li>

<li>9:03 AM&nbsp;– Family-friendly Fun Run/Walk (Free with early registration!)<br>Sign up early at&nbsp;<a href="http://www.tincupchallenge.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">www.TinCupChallenge.com</a>&nbsp;or at the Foundation booth at the&nbsp;Driggs Farmers Market&nbsp;on Fridays, 9 AM–1 PM.<br>Day-of registration is $10&nbsp;for the Fun Run/Walk. All racers get a&nbsp;free Tin Cup T-shirt&nbsp;(while supplies last)!</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Stay for the Fun</strong><br>After the run, enjoy:</p>

<ul>
<li>FREE community breakfast</li>

<li>Booths from&nbsp;58 nonprofits</li>

<li>Kids activities:&nbsp;Diaper Derby,&nbsp;soap hockey,&nbsp;folkloric dancing, and even a&nbsp;flight simulator!</li>

<li>A petting zoo with horses, mules, mini-horses, and adoptable puppies!</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Dress to Impress</strong><br>Support your favorite nonprofit with spirited costumes, and your organization could win the Tin Cup Spirit Award – with prizes of $200, $100, and $75!<br>Awards begin at 10:30 AM on the Event Stage, including the Dawn Banks Award, Race Awards, and Spirit Awards.</p>

</figure>

<p> <strong>Make Your Gift Go Further</strong><br>Every dollar matters. Every gift counts.<br>Give today – cash, check, stocks, or online at <a href="http://www.tincupchallenge.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">www.TinCupChallenge.com</a> – and your donation will be partially<strong> </strong>matched thanks to Business &amp; Community Challengers.<br><strong>Deadline to give: </strong>Friday, July 25 at 5 PM.</p>

<p>Don’t miss this chance to&nbsp;connect with your community, support vital causes, and give back while having a blast.</p>

<p>Questions? Visit&nbsp;<a href="https://cftetonvalley.org/">www.cftetonvalley.org</a>, call&nbsp;208.354.0230, email&nbsp;info@cftetonvalley.org, or find us at the Farmers Market or our office at 189 N. Main St., Suite 112, Driggs.</p>

<p><strong>Celebrate generosity. Support local.&nbsp;</strong><strong>Accept</strong><strong>&nbsp;the Challenge</strong><strong>.</strong><br>We can’t wait to see you on July 19th!</p>
